4\u3066\u306f\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u304b\u3089\u8a73\u7d30\u3092\u3054\u78ba\u8a8d\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\nhttps:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/FMCAsia2025\n\nFMC Asia 2025 will be held on the same day at the same venue.\nFMC Asia start time is after the end of this competition (3:00PM).\nYou can participate in both this competition and FMC Asia 2025.\nFor more information about FMC Asia 2025, please click the link below.\nhttps:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/FMCAsia2025","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"Kadiliman2025","name":"Kadiliman 2025","city":"Quezon City","country":"PH","date":{"from":"2025-07-27","till":"2025-07-27","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Yuji Yoshida","email":"yyoshida@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Yuji Yoshida","email":"yyoshida@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"Sikat Inc.","address":"J2PP+55 Quezon City, Metro Manila","details":"V2 Studio","coordinates":{"latitude":14.63554,"longitude":121.035259}},"information":"![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6OTk3MDUsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--75528168fca30084c1433bde58cba17e9fc7d9e9\/a594eb4a-81ac-4f77-80c6-19b0a5d8c79e.jpg)","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"FMCAsia2025","name":"FMC Asia 2025","city":"Multiple Cities","country":"XA","date":{"from":"2025-07-27","till":"2025-07-27","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Akula Sai Kumar","email":"akumar1@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Amitai Ziv","email":"aziv@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Arnab Banik","email":"abanik@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Asami Ohkusa","email":"asami.ohkusa@speedcubing.or.jp"},{"name":"Cendy Cahyo Rahmat","email":"crahmat@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Chris Krueger","email":"ckrueger@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Damir Zhanataev","email":"dzhanata